        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Update speculation rules data to indicate Firefox support]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30803</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30803"/>
        <updated>2026-10-08T17:07:47.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Firefox 155 enabled support for a limited subset of <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/script/type/speculationrules" rel="nofollow">speculation rules</a> functionality, in Nightly only. From looking at <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2041381#c11" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2041381#c11</a>, it appears that</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>only <code class="notranslate">prefetch</code> is supported (not prerender)</li>
<li>with <code class="notranslate">immediate</code> <code class="notranslate">eagerness</code> only</li>
<li>and only a <code class="notranslate">urls</code> list, which means that the <code class="notranslate">source</code> value of <code class="notranslate">list</code> is also supported.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Firefox 158 added the <code class="notranslate">moderate</code> eagerness value; see <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2061013" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2061013</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR aims to update the relevant support data to indicate all of this.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5617214751" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45895" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45895/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45895">mdn/content#45895</a></p>

]]></content>
